Network Impairment adds what pfSense limiters have and the OPNsense Traffic
Shaper does not show: a packet loss rate (dummynet "plr") and a latency for a
shaper pipe, to simulate a bad WAN link in a lab.

Pick a pipe under Firewall > Shaper > Impairment, set the latency (ms) and the
packet loss (%), and Apply. Traffic is sent into the pipe by the normal
Traffic Shaper rules.
